  "title": {
    "zh_CN": "第六课 · 连贯与乐句",
    "en_US": "Lesson 6 · Legato and phrasing"
  },
  "goal": {
    "zh_CN": "让一组音成为连贯乐句，在指定休止处结束。",
    "en_US": "Connect notes into a phrase and release before the rest."
  },
  "steps": {
    "zh_CN": "1. 用 a 唱前半句，保持元音连贯。\n2. 延音弧连接的两个 3 只起唱一次。\n3. 在休止处停止，再用 u 唱下一句。\n4. 回放录音，自查是否逐音断开。",
    "en_US": "1. Sing the first phrase on a with a connected vowel.\n2. Attack the tied pair of 3s only once.\n3. Stop in the rest, then sing the next phrase on u.\n4. Replay your recording and listen for unwanted breaks."
  },
  "selfCheck": {
    "zh_CN": "延音是否被重新起唱？句尾是否拖进休止？连贯度请结合录音自查。",
    "en_US": "Did you re-attack a tie? Did the release extend into the rest? Judge legato by listening to your recording."
  },
